cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RustyDroid, cite it with this metadata."
title: RustyDroid
abstract: >-
  Rust-native Android runtime that executes real APKs on Linux x86_64 without a
  VM, KVM or a guest kernel. Parses APK/AXML/ARSC/DEX, runs Dalvik bytecode in a
  Rust VM, implements android.* APIs natively, renders headless, and exposes an
  MCP control plane built for AI agents. Calibrated against a Moto E5 floor
  (API 26→36).
type: software
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nadabgfccvd/RustyDroid"
url: "https://github.com/nadabgfccvd/RustyDroid"
version: 0.9.0
keywords:
  - android
  - rust
  - runtime
  - dalvik
  - apk
  - mcp
  - ai-agents
  - headless
